mutant: m060_drain_collapses_seq_lease
target: internal/ingest/writer.go
failure-mode: |
  DrainDurability uses terminal-close semantics and collapses max_reserved to
  exact nextSeq even though the writer remains open. Subsequent client-visible
  allocation has no durable lease and wedges or escapes the publication guard.
